{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37723","headline":"将之泸郡旅次遂州遇裴晤员外谪居於此话旧凄凉因寄二首 二 · 郑谷","name":"将之泸郡旅次遂州遇裴晤员外谪居於此话旧凄凉因寄二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年共照松溪影，松折溪荒僧已无。\n今日重思锦城事，雪销花谢梦何殊。\n乱离未定身俱老，骚雅全休道甚孤。\n我拜师门更南去，荔枝春熟向渝泸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}